control: A stored grant stamped later than the request that sees it counts for one second from that request and then leaves the window
removes: a stored grant's stamp is held to the stored latest instant rather than the request's, so a stored instant that came back behind moves every real grant out of the window
packages: ./ratelimit/core
tests: TestNoRunIssuesPastTheHardCap TestIssue TestAFutureStampCountsForOneSecondFromTheRequestThatSeesIt
scheduled-count: no

